OpenRetro reads these lines from the session log: the achievement set a game
loaded, each unlock, and a failed sign-in, so the launcher can show them.
Upstream does not build with achievements and without the menu: the menu
state reads a menu setting, and without a menu that state never runs.

diff --git a/cheevos/cheevos.c b/cheevos/cheevos.c
index fd4aabbbac..be2f40c4b8 100644
